stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Pending : create() — reviewStatus defaults to "Pending" (touchCreated)

    Pending --> Approved : PATCH /justifications/{id}/review (reviewedBy, reviewedAt, resolutionNotes)
    Pending --> Rejected : PATCH /justifications/{id}/review (reviewedBy, reviewedAt, resolutionNotes)

    note right of Pending
        Verified 2026-10-12 against FULL/ — corrected: Approved and Rejected
        are terminal. ReviewJustificationUseCaseImpl rejects review() whenever
        the current reviewStatus is not Pending ("a resolved justification
        cannot be reviewed again"), so Approved --> Rejected and
        Rejected --> Approved do NOT exist. reviewStatus=Pending as a target
        is also rejected ("Cannot review to Pending").
    end note

    note right of Approved
        Publishing an event and flipping attendance_record.attendance_status
        to "Justified" are NOT part of review() — approval does not cascade.
        requires_attachment IS enforced before Approved: the use case 404s
        with "requires at least one supporting document" when the type
        requires one and no SupportingDocument row exists for this
        justification. It only checks row existence, not that the row's
        storageUri points at a real uploaded file (see cls-attendance.puml —
        no byte upload exists anywhere, ADR-009).
    end note

    Pending --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
    Approved --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
    Rejected --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
